## 9. The features the model uses

The model uses **27 input features** (8 categorical + 19 numeric; 252 columns after one-hot encoding). Each is available **before dispatch**.

| Group | Features | In plain words |
|---|---|---|
| **Logistics** | `Shipping_Mode`, `Days_for_shipment_scheduled`, `Market`, `Order_Region`, `Order_Country` | How the order will ship, how many days the shipping promise is, and where it is going. *Shipping mode and scheduled days are the strongest drivers.* |
| **Payment** | `Type`, `is_cash` | Payment method (e.g. DEBIT, TRANSFER, PAYMENT, CASH). See the TRANSFER caveat in [limitations](#13-honest-limitations-read-before-you-trust-a-number). |
| **Customer & product** | `Customer_Segment`, `Department_Name`, `main_item_category`, `n_distinct_categories` | Who is buying and what category of goods. |
| **Order size** | `order_value`, `n_items`, `value_per_item`, `avg_discount_rate`, `high_discount_flag` | Basket value, number of items, value per item, discount depth and a "heavily discounted" flag. |
| **Timing** | `order_month`, `order_dow`, `order_hour`, `is_weekend`, `is_night_order` | When the order was placed (month, day of week, hour, weekend, night). Order hour matters for Same Day orders. |
| **Customer / country history** | `customer_prev_orders`, `customer_prev_late_rate`, `customer_prev_cash_share`, `days_since_prev_order`, `country_prev_orders`, `country_prev_late_rate` | What happened on this customer's and this country's **earlier** orders — using only orders whose outcome was already observable at the time of the new order (leakage-safe). Country rates are smoothed (Bayesian prior) so small countries don't produce wild values. |

### What the model is *never* allowed to see

These are blocked in `src/config.py` (`FORBIDDEN_FEATURES`) and checked by automated tests:

- **Post-dispatch outcomes:** `Days for shipping (real)`, `Delivery Status`, `Order Status`, `shipping date`, profit columns.
- **The evaluation-only secondary target** `aux_target_cancel_fraud` (cancelled / suspected-fraud orders), used only to evaluate.
- **Personal data:** customer name, e-mail, password, street, zip code.
- **Identifiers and free text:** product image, product description.

